# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraform.tfstate.lock.info
*tfplan*
.terraformrc
terraform.rc
# NOTE: .terraform.lock.hcl is intentionally committed (provider pinning)

# Secrets / keys
*.pem
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Local-only credentials (Slack tokens for the ops agent: docs/ai-ops.md)
local/secrets/

# Build output
build/
.gradle/
out/
target/
*.class
*.jar
!**/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/

# IDE / OS
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Packaged artifacts
*.zip

# Raw Java Flight Recordings (large); summaries live in docs/performance/results
*.jfr
docs/performance/data/

# GitOps snapshot mirror (a separate Git directory pushed to the in-cluster Gitea)
.gitops-mirror/

# Account-specific values from Terraform (aws-values.sh): pushed to the cluster's Gitea, never committed.
helm/values/generated/
gitops/operators/*/generated-*.yaml

# Local guidance for Claude Code; not part of the repository
CLAUDE.md
